This is interesting, thanx.  I remember many years ago I learned
to trade thrown daggers with lines of advancing orcs.  A good
dagger will often kill an orc and the next one will pick it up and
throw it back.  Since orcs miss a lot more than most player
characters this is a dangerous but effective strategy.  Especially
if you start with a lot of daggers.  I remember that Sting with its
double damage would almost always kill one orc, then the
next twould throw it back and miss me.  I called it "Sting-pong".
Somewhere along the line, still a long time ago, orcs stopped
picking up Sting.



